  "stem": "<p style=\"text-align: center;\"><math alttext=\"negative 11\"><mo>-</mo><mn>11</mn>\n</math>, <math alttext=\"negative 9\"><mo>-</mo><mn>9</mn>\n</math>, <math alttext=\"26\"><mn>26</mn>\n</math></p>\n<p style=\"text-align: left;\">A data set of three numbers is shown. If a number from this data set is selected at random, what is the probability of selecting a positive number?</p>",
